<description>&lt;p&gt;Libyan armed forces keep conducting extrajudicial executions, breaking a 15-year moratorium, while eastern authorities hold dozens of detainees at risk of execution. Haftar's forces have signed a strategic cooperation protocol with Niger, and a RPG shell caused a factory blast in Sebha that killed two people. Jordan and Libya discussed joint military training, coordination and exchange of defense expertise, and an armed group shut the Hamada pipeline valve, halting crude supplies to the Al-Zawiya refinery. 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPbl9VaXdNT2lsZXpKY2tiLTFNaHFfekpVMDdCa2M4R05xNC1pN0c0d0pHcHJPVG5mNDBXMTFFSFNLdFNzSXFVRndrM1RiM0hLQ0dueXUtYUVHNnRWdDlfWkM0aUEwbF9PLU5iajRzdFBBUzBGWDVKUGIwdVBQOVZsaTlPNXBlVWFzdTVWV0cxcGNGNUNtOXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Libya Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxOSVJTNGdtNXpmTFVYUkh4N0FDbGNXVHNjQzFhb2hFYm85dzAxYWEzYUZFVEs1bGVVZkFEYVBoZ2xOM29UbFkzSGpMVVRlWVBOQUd4SzVsckpIQlN0UlBILUtJZTZDU2pkVS1SaHNzMHZ5bE1aY3NGampyNUprUkMwZGNkWWlyQjJxOS1HV3lPYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Libya Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTFBEUTQ2YXZKUklMSGdEal9oZjVMeDg1ZjhZVXFqWmVIZFYtVDZST01aLVBfektWcEJob0ZCYVVKZzZqWFRkVXR6aVZhNENJM29xX2gtZGU3WFlRWWgyalMzV2lEVlZ3dzFyYlRyeFRHeHhwZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Open Doors UK &amp;amp; Ireland&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxQcVBBbmNtODlXYkpRWkxDaE1yTFlySzVVR2NNazZpM1BBalYyY3IwRm9TNlptMXJSTnM1NFRKWDlNdUJPbWtQYTJmM3dRbThFeTdfQzNhTzloY2I3LVVBeENqQlM0Z1RzdkNnZklUcENiODh3Z0NjTVFyb2JSU0ZRSERXSTAzVGQyTGlZOEZSbk5KT3BKZXBVczFyMFRpVzNlaERGN2l3WmNtWGVUMURrSHFCbnU1dzRfLXVZcm8yS19CZlk?oc=5&quo